BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 177.35 Tm (model-serving software that optimizes loading and inference. YourTechGuru instead describes OpenRouter as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 162.12 Tm (managed SaaS whose traffic crosses its endpoint, and LiteLLM as an open-source proxy server and Python SDK.) Tj ET
