BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (capital-of-France question offers much less opportunity because its input is already small. Aman Chauhan adds) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (separate exact-response, semantic-response, and tool-result caches rather than treating these as names for the same) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (mechanism. Exact matching can return a stored answer; semantic matching can recognize differently worded) Tj ET
