0.6 w 54.00 747.00 m 558.00 747.00 l S
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (The sharpest disagreement is how far automation can carry payment recovery. Churnkey promotes an automated) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (combination of retries, payment walls, and campaigns; its involuntary-churn presentation reports recovery of up to 70%) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (of failed payments, while its multichannel presentation claims up to 89% across the channels it describes. Gravy argues) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (that dunning software and automated emails alone are not enough, saying 85% of people are not responsive to those) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (efforts. Its alternative has three ingredients: a person focused on recovery, a proven one-to-one communication process,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (and visibility into the recovery metric. Gravy attributes over 70% of saved payments to a person sending a customized) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (email and reports average recovery of 51% of failed revenue within 30 days. Freemius puts a different question ahead) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (of buying another service: what is already included in the payment platform? It identifies built-in dunning, standalone) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (software, and building internally as three routes, then says standalone tools offer more control but run from about $130) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (to $269 monthly. Freemius includes its own dunning without an extra tool fee. The choices therefore differ in staffing,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (platform packaging, and claimed results: Churnkey sells automation breadth, Gravy sells dedicated human attention,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (and Freemius tells sellers to inspect existing recovery numbers before purchasing another tool. [O51fzGSuixY @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (00:02:07] [vp4SwMY-QrM @ 00:02:21] [7MuS7PqfUyo @ 00:00:31] [iJ-6ibkTVyg @ 00:00:17]) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (Cancellation handling also has competing operating styles. Vasco Aires deliberately adds steps: a video and invitation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (to book a call, a cancellation-reason form requiring a substantive comment, an option to send feedback and wait for the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (team, and a final confirmation emphasizing what the customer loses. Vasco explicitly rejects the extreme of making) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (customers call during a narrow window, but still says the business tries to delay cancellation and gather as much) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (feedback as possible. Dan Martell's early-stage suggestion is a conversation before automatic cancellation, potentially) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (through email, when the team does not yet understand why people leave; later, those responses can become) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (self-cancellation choices and roadmap input. Raaft centers the reason-matched response instead: show the next charge) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (and exact end date for billing confusion, repair a broken cancellation path, offer human contact for support problems,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (and offer a cheaper plan or pause for price objections. RonBuilds narrows where intensive save work belongs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (Activated, engaged, valuable customers with a clear reason may justify personalized win-back treatment; low-value,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (price-sensitive users who are unlikely to stay may not. These approaches put different weight on conversation,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (deliberate cancellation friction, and matching the remedy to the reason. Vasco's sequence also distinguishes a final) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (cancellation from sending feedback and waiting, which leaves the subscription uncanceled. [HrOp5FtcoxM @) Tj ET
